interaction creator-arrangement-to-native-mix
  source service-creator-audio
  destination creator-browser-mix
  relation pointer_keyboard_and_waveform_selection_to_validated_integer_frame_clips
  preserves original source identities, sample clocks, placement, source bounds, gain, mute and ordered native PCM output
  drops waveform-library playback, server uploads and visual-only edits
  forbidden_inference a waveform gesture -> rendered success before the native worker validates and returns the new mix
  invalidates_on gesture rounding, source selection, native clip validation or packaged waveform modules changing
